    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TitTok 2 - Minimalistic adventure 2D puzzle platformer with cats, explosions and spinning saws! Continuation of the first part.</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1764810/extras/fd7f0b6dd893b44bd3e5927d4bfb9864.poster.avif?t=1745382057\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1764810/extras/fd7f0b6dd893b44bd3e5927d4bfb9864.webm?t=1745382057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1764810/extras/fd7f0b6dd893b44bd3e5927d4bfb9864.mp4?t=1745382057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><i>Continuation of the legendary TitTok game: Bigger, Cooler, More Epic! The player's goal is to complete all levels and not die from the attacks of evil enemies and traps!<br>You can find bombs on levels and plant them ANYWHERE, even in the air!</i><br><br>\u25aa Kitties ^. ^<br>\u25aa Atmospheric soundtrack by <strong>Sun Candles</strong><br>\u25aa Three levels of Difficulty<br>\u25aa Story: 31 levels<br>\u25aa Puzzles: 6 levels<br>\u25aa Unlimited number of Bombs and Massive explosions<br>\u25aa Double jumps<br>\u25aa Lasers, Cannons<br>\u25aa Moving platforms, Portals<br>\u25aa Beautiful effects<br>\u25aa A cool Plot, a direct continuation of the first part<br>\u25aa A variety of enemies, Mini-Bosses and a cool Super Boss<br>\u25aa Large, long and beautiful levels<br>\u25aa And much more..<br><br><strong>..And in the game you can MEOW at any time ^^</strong><br><strong>TitTok 2 - Bigger, Cooler, More Epic!</strong><br><strong>TikTok? No! TitTok! TikTok \u2260 TitTok</strong><br><strong>And remember: &quot;Tit before your Tok!&quot;</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TitTok 2 - Minimalistic adventure 2D puzzle platformer with cats, explosions and spinning saws! Continuation of the first part.</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1764810/extras/fd7f0b6dd893b44bd3e5927d4bfb9864.poster.avif?t=1745382057\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1764810/extras/fd7f0b6dd893b44bd3e5927d4bfb9864.webm?t=1745382057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1764810/extras/fd7f0b6dd893b44bd3e5927d4bfb9864.mp4?t=1745382057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><i>Continuation of the legendary TitTok game: Bigger, Cooler, More Epic! The player's goal is to complete all levels and not die from the attacks of evil enemies and traps!<br>You can find bombs on levels and plant them ANYWHERE, even in the air!</i><br><br>\u25aa Kitties ^. ^<br>\u25aa Atmospheric soundtrack by <strong>Sun Candles</strong><br>\u25aa Three levels of Difficulty<br>\u25aa Story: 31 levels<br>\u25aa Puzzles: 6 levels<br>\u25aa Unlimited number of Bombs and Massive explosions<br>\u25aa Double jumps<br>\u25aa Lasers, Cannons<br>\u25aa Moving platforms, Portals<br>\u25aa Beautiful effects<br>\u25aa A cool Plot, a direct continuation of the first part<br>\u25aa A variety of enemies, Mini-Bosses and a cool Super Boss<br>\u25aa Large, long and beautiful levels<br>\u25aa And much more..<br><br><strong>..And in the game you can MEOW at any time ^^</strong><br><strong>TitTok 2 - Bigger, Cooler, More Epic!</strong><br><strong>TikTok? No! TitTok! TikTok \u2260 TitTok</strong><br><strong>And remember: &quot;Tit before your Tok!&quot;</strong>",
